#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/tailscale.rs:204
msgid "Failed to run tailscale"
msgstr "Kunne ikke kjøre tailscale"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/tailscale.rs:224
